flow=[Paragraph('Vélu generators and Frobenius stability',t),
 p('<b>Source qualification.</b> The published square-root Vélu paper’s §4.14 extends to irrational generators and says Frobenius maps P to [λ]P. That scalar need not exist for an arbitrary extension-field point: its cyclic subgroup must be preserved. Lean proves an actual nonsingular elliptic counterpoint over F25 and the exact cyclic-stability criterion. The paragraph may intend a rational cyclic kernel from the isogeny context; that qualified context and the main rational-generator theorem are retained. [pcc:unverified]'),d,Spacer(1,8),
 p('<b>Actual prime3 counterpoint.</b> Let E/F5 be y²=x³+1 and K=GaloisField(5,2). Lean proves |K|=25 and actual extension degree2. It constructs a²=2, actual nonsingular A=(0,1) and B=(1,a), both killed by3. The actual coordinate 5-Frobenius fixes A and sends B to −B. The actual point P=A+B has exact order3, is outside the rational base-point image and has Frobenius image outside its own cyclic subgroup. Thus no integer scalar, and consequently no scalar modulo3, can represent its Frobenius image. Prime3 and coprimality with characteristic5 are checked. [pcc:unverified]'),
 p('<b>Geometry and group reasoning.</b> All objects are actual Mathlib nonsingular Point groups. The actual division quartic proves3-torsion; actual field Frobenius and Point.map derive the actions. A proved curve-equality AddEquiv transports the point statements without an assumed coordinate/group bridge. Fixed and anti-fixed nonzero3-torsion cannot produce a Frobenius eigenline by summing: equality to P or −P would force a nonzero3-torsion point also to be killed by2. No matrix-only replacement or torsion/Frobenius conclusion premise is used. [pcc:unverified]'),
 p('<b>Repair and positive control.</b> For every additive commutative group, actual endomorphism F and actual cyclic subgroup generated by P, Lean proves preservation of that subgroup iff an integer k satisfies kP=F(P). The same actual F25 curve supplies an irrational generator B of exact order3 whose subgroup is preserved, with F(B)=−B. Non-rationality alone therefore does not invalidate the intended extension. [pcc:unverified]'),
 p('<b>Boundary.</b> This audits the literal irrational-point relaxation and its missing stability qualification. It does not refute Theorem4.11’s rational-generator operation count, establish arbitrary rational-kernel input sufficiency, or verify the whole isogeny/runtime implementation. Point evaluation is distinct from outputting all rational-map coefficients; field operations are distinct from bit or physical cost. No claim is made about the ambiguous minimal x-coordinate degree versus eigenvalue order, or canonical kernel Galois descent. Known cyclic-group method credited; no novelty claim. [pcc:unverified]'),
 p(f'<b>Checks and provenance.</b> Whole project gate {g["declarations"]}/0 failures/0 trusted native, only propext/Classical.choice/Quot.sound. Complete1385-character binding {binding}; independent native1complete/0prefix/0unresolved. Native parsing/hashing is procedural, not kernel refinement. Nine snapshots retain six failed states: {a["files"]}files/{a["unique_objects"]}objects/{size}-byte losslessXZ plus five final gate files. Lean4.35.0/Mathlib56a00585…/defaults/frozen dependencies unchanged; no holes/customaxioms/native evaluator/raised limits/newglobalflags/waivers/newcryptoexperiment/spend/upload. Old dependency options/advisories retained. Signed standing unverified. [pcc:unverified]'),
 p('<b>Sources checked.</b> Bernstein–DeFeo–Leroux–Smith, Faster computation of isogenies of large prime degree, DOI10.2140/obs.2020.4.39: selected printed47–49/PDF10–12 read,11–12 visually inspected; not full20-page publisher PDF. Full22-page arXiv2003.10118v1 prose/math/appendix read, with selected figures inspected; Fig1–3 rendering limitation retained, no benchmark replay. Exact §4.14 wording appears in both versions. Prior actual torsion/Frobenius and official Point/GaloisField/order/subgroup APIs read. KB/Conductor127; primary/prior/official fallback. Original Vélu1971 primary remains unread here; copyright sources remain local. [pcc:unverified]')]
SimpleDocTemplate(str(o/'report.pdf'),pagesize=(595.276,841.89),leftMargin=47,rightMargin=47,topMargin=35,bottomMargin=35).build(flow)
doc=fitz.open(o/'report.pdf');layout={'pages':[],'visual_inspection':'pending'}
for i,page in enumerate(doc):
 bad=[]
 for block in page.get_text('dict')['blocks']:
  for line in block.get('lines',[]):
   for span in line['spans']:
    x0,y0,x1,y1=span['bbox']
    if x0<0 or y0<0 or x1>page.rect.width or y1>page.rect.height:bad.append(span['text'])
 layout['pages'].append({'page':i+1,'text_within_page':not bad,'out_of_bounds':bad})
 page.get_pixmap(matrix=fitz.Matrix(1.25,1.25)).save('/workspace/scratch/velu-frob-report-'+str(i+1)+'.png')
